/*
  ============================================================
  CODE 3 MX7000 - GIGA DISPLAY CONTROLLER
  Arduino GIGA R1 WiFi + GIGA Display Shield
  ============================================================

  GIGA <-> NANO ESP32 UART
  -----------------------
  GIGA D1 TX  -> Nano D12 RX
  GIGA D0 RX  <- Nano D13 TX
  GIGA GND    -> Nano GND
  Baud: 38400


  ============================================================
  TOUCH BEHAVIOR
  ============================================================

  NORMAL TAP:

      Finger down
          |
          v
      Button is remembered
          |
          v
      NO COMMAND SENT
          |
          v
      Finger released
          |
          v
      100ms continuous no-touch
          |
          v
      Command sent ONCE


  LONG PRESS:

      Finger down
          |
          v
      Hold >= 2 seconds
          |
          v
      Mark as LONG PRESS
          |
          v
      NO COMMAND SENT YET
          |
          v
      Finger released
          |
          v
      100ms continuous no-touch
          |
          v
      Override command sent ONCE


  Short 4-5ms touch-controller dropouts are ignored.


  ============================================================
  BUTTON COLORS
  ============================================================

  DARK
    Inactive

  BLUE
    Physical switch active

  FLASHING BLUE
    Physical switch active during startup hold

  RED
    Physical switch active but overridden by GIGA

  FLASHING PURPLE
    Waiting for final START/STOP confirmation

  SOLID PURPLE
    Confirmation timeout

  GREEN
    GIGA request active and Mega confirmed


  ============================================================
*/


